WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.817
Rex looked for flowers.

2
00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:13.513
He found a sunny hill.

3
00:00:13.514 --> 00:00:20.663
Flowers were everywhere.

4
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:27.495
Rex picked a bunch of flowers.

5
00:00:27.496 --> 00:00:33.799
"These will help Sid," he said.

6
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:39.825
Tor flew around.

7
00:00:39.826 --> 00:00:44.095
She spotted a pond below.

8
00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:47.351
"Water for Sid!" Tor said.

9
00:00:47.352 --> 00:00:50.044
Tor landed near the pond.

10
00:00:50.045 --> 00:00:52.567
"Hmm," she said.

11
00:00:52.568 --> 00:00:57.539
"How will I carry the water?"

12
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.246
Tor dug through her bag.

13
00:01:00.247 --> 00:01:01.840
She found a bucket.

14
00:01:01.841 --> 00:01:10.652
Tor grinned. "Perfect!"

15
00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:13.258
Sara found plants.

16
00:01:13.259 --> 00:01:17.940
They had big, wide leaves.

17
00:01:17.941 --> 00:01:22.571
"These leaves are big," Sara said.

18
00:01:22.572 --> 00:01:27.346
"Sid can use them as blankets."

19
00:01:27.347 --> 00:01:34.476
Sara picked leaves.

20
00:01:34.477 --> 00:01:38.093
She went back to the field.

21
00:01:38.094 --> 00:01:42.939
Sara saw Rex and Tor.

22
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:46.420
"I have leaves," Sara said.

23
00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:49.804
"I have flowers," Rex said.

24
00:01:49.805 --> 00:01:51.800
Tor held up the bucket.

25
00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:56.657
"I have water."

26
00:01:56.658 --> 00:02:02.536
The buddies went to find Sid.

27
00:02:02.537 --> 00:02:06.736
Sara gasped.

28
00:02:06.737 --> 00:02:10.610
"Sid's gone!"

